    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>A couple years have passed since you moved out from your family's house. A few notes and letters you recently found prompt you to visit them. Unbeknownst to you, this is part of his plan...<br><br>Lost Souls is an atmospheric walking simulator in which you encounter a plethora of paranormal creatures, alongside the traps and mind games that serve as the remnants of the house's owner. Set in a middle-class house deep within dense forest vegetation, you'll unveil unsettling secrets through its hidden passages, trap doors, and remains of the terrible experiments performed inside. The game's pleasing visuals and realistic camera movement create an exciting, immersive experience for you to get sucked into.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING</h2><br><strong>Epilepsy warning; game includes rapidly flashing lights.<br>Beware game does not save<br>~50 minutes long </strong>",
